Update time: 2017/12/22

Update content:
1. Now, we support players using Oculus devices to play the game;

2. The graphics of the game have been further optimized, more gorgeous, more fluent, we hope that this can make better experience;

3. Adjust the operation of the bow, make it more fluent, now it’s easier to operate;

4. Enhanced effects of the magic of meteorites and black dragon wave. We hope that the spell power of multiple spell triggers is more powerful than the attraction of monsters. This adjustment can help us better define the location of this kind of magic.

5. Added touch mobile function. According to the player's feedback, we made this adjustment. Now, players can move through touching the corresponding direction of the disk of the VIVE left hand controller, and the original press continues to move, so it doesn't conflict with each other.

6. Added the left hand trigger. In the game, the player can sprint or jump by double clicking the opposite direction of the left hand disk. Now, when you move in a certain direction, press the trigger of the left hand controller and will also trigger the sprint or jump effect in the corresponding direction.

7. Adjust the mana book page operation. Now you can just page the magic book by touching the left and right directions of the VIVE right hand controller. No longer need to be pressed.

8. Adjust the part of the sound effect in the game.

